Subject: Re: sam() producing different results depending on method of factor identification
Message-ID: <lNfiReOerzE.YUs1nSu3CAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <lNfiReOerzE.aTiNH2zCBAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
