indirect := pnorm(probit11) - pnorm(probit10)

direct := pnorm(probit10) - pnorm(probit00)

OR.indirect := (pnorm(probit11)/(1-pnorm(probit11)))/ (pnorm(probit10)/(1-pnorm(probit10)))

OR.direct := (pnorm(probit10)/(1-pnorm(probit10)))/ (pnorm(probit00)/(1-pnorm(probit00)))
I noticed the p-values were not matching the CIs when obtained with the code. I thought it might be because lavaan was testing based on an the null hypothesis that the coefficient equals zero (H₀: β = 0), which might not hold for OR since the null is OR = 1.
